and interact with the exercise files, which are Codespaces.

12
00:00:25,04 --> 00:00:27,03
Codespaces is a code editor

13
00:00:27,03 --> 00:00:30,01
directly available in the cloud with the full power

14
00:00:30,01 --> 00:00:31,07
of Visual Studio Code.

15
00:00:31,07 --> 00:00:33,05
You will see that this is very convenient

16
00:00:33,05 --> 00:00:36,05
