17
00:00:36,05 --> 00:00:39,01
With Codespaces, it is easy to get started.

18
00:00:39,01 --> 00:00:41,00
I will walk through through the steps.

19
00:00:41,00 --> 00:00:42,04
So to practice along with the course,

20
00:00:42,04 --> 00:00:44,00
you will have access to Codespaces

21
00:00:44,00 --> 00:00:47,02
directly from the course page if you are already logged in.

22
00:00:47,02 --> 00:00:48,06
Otherwise, you will be prompted

23
00:00:48,06 --> 00:00:51,00
to create a new GitHub account first.

24
00:00:51,00 --> 00:00:53,01
So the first time that you open up Codespaces

25
00:00:53,01 --> 00:00:54,06
it may take a few minutes to create

26
00:00:54,06 --> 00:00:58,08
a new virtual machine that we're going to access from here.

27
00:00:58,08 --> 00:00:59,08
And once this is ready,

28
00:00:59,08 --> 00:01:03,00
you will enter the Code Editor environment.

29
00:01:03,00 --> 00:01:04,06
And if you're familiar with the Code Editor

30
00:01:04,06 --> 00:01:07,03
of Visual Studio Code you will feel right at home.

31
00:01:07,03 --> 00:01:10,03
This is a special and virtual version of Visual Studio Code

32
00:01:10,03 --> 00:01:11,07
that you already know.

33
00:01:11,07 --> 00:01:15,07
So on the left, there is a toolbar with a project explorer,

34
00:01:15,07 --> 00:01:18,07
a search and a debugging feature.

35
00:01:18,07 --> 00:01:21,05
Also with the options to do version control.

36
00:01:21,05 --> 00:01:23,02
Plus, you have access to plugins

37
00:01:23,02 --> 00:01:25,09
and extensions in order to add more capabilities

38
00:01:25,09 --> 00:01:28,05
to your online code editor.

39
00:01:28,05 --> 00:01:29,09
And because this is a browser,

40
00:01:29,09 --> 00:01:32,03
it is easy to close the browser window by mistake

41
00:01:32,03 --> 00:01:35,03
and to lose the editor but if you do that, no panic

42
00:01:35,03 --> 00:01:37,09
because Codespaces saves everything that you're doing

43
00:01:37,09 --> 00:01:39,05
on the virtual machine.

44
00:01:39,05 --> 00:01:41,02
So whenever you go back to the editor,

45
00:01:41,02 --> 00:01:43,06
it'll be exactly where you're left off.

46
00:01:43,06 --> 00:01:46,08
So this is very convenient to work with Codespaces.

47
00:01:46,08 --> 00:01:49,00
No development environment setup is required.

48
00:01:49,00 --> 00:01:52,00
There is no need for tools or libraries installation.

49
00:01:52,00 --> 00:01:53,07
Everything is ready to get started.

50
00:01:53,07 --> 00:01:56,06
All you need is a modern browser and high speed internet.

51
00:01:56,06 --> 00:01:58,09
One click and you're ready to go.

52
00:01:58,09 --> 00:02:00,07
For every demonstration of the class

