00:02:00,07 --> 00:02:03,05
you will have access to the corresponding exercise files

54
00:02:03,05 --> 00:02:05,07
with a starter and a final version.

55
00:02:05,07 --> 00:02:07,02
And if you ever decide to start

56
00:02:07,02 --> 00:02:09,02
at a specific point of time in the class,

57
00:02:09,02 --> 00:02:12,03
for example, chapter two and video zero one,

58
00:02:12,03 --> 00:02:14,01
