64
00:02:30,06 --> 00:02:32,07
The React Developer tool is a development

65
00:02:32,07 --> 00:02:33,09
and a debugging tool.

66
00:02:33,09 --> 00:02:35,08
Very useful during the demonstration

67
00:02:35,08 --> 00:02:38,03
and the development process because you have access

68
00:02:38,03 --> 00:02:41,00
to the application tree of your React application

69
00:02:41,00 --> 00:02:42,06
