70
00:02:42,06 --> 00:02:44,08
To inspect the state and the props

71
00:02:44,08 --> 00:02:46,08
that you can see on the right left side.

72
00:02:46,08 --> 00:02:49,02
And all you need to do is to add to your browser.

73
00:02:49,02 --> 00:02:51,02
So you should read Add to Chrome in my case

74
00:02:51,02 --> 00:02:52,05
because this is already installed,

75
00:02:52,05 --> 00:02:54,04
you can read remove from Chrome,

76
00:02:54,04 --> 00:02:56,02
but you should read add to Chrome

77
00:02:56,02 --> 00:02:58,02
